(1, 19, 2, '2026-01-13', 'LIFE-19-NARRATIVE', 'Djanisse Villaflor', '2025-07-13', '2026-02-12', 28550.00, 'Batangas State University', 'The project completed the activities and physical targets defined in its approved Work Plan.', '[{\"output\": \"Waiting time and safety evaluation\", \"activity\": \"Run paired trials across clinic days\"}, {\"output\": \"Deployed triage assistant\", \"activity\": \"Build the assistant and clinic dashboard\"}, {\"output\": \"Triage workflow reference model\", \"activity\": \"Shadow triage nurses and encode workflow rules\"}]', 'This narrative consolidates implementation activities and measured outcomes.', 'The project addressed a documented operational and community need.', 'Compare waiting times and triage accuracy\nImplement the triage and queue assistant\nStudy triage workflows in partner health units', 'The team used developmental research and mixed-method evaluation.', 'Results show that the principal objectives and performance targets were achieved.', '[]', 'submitted', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-12 16:00:00', NULL, 'reviewed', NULL, 1, '2026-01-15 16:00:00', '2026-09-13 02:30:10', '2026-09-27 06:50:07', 'progress', NULL),
