6218528cfaba0ec764eee\"}, \"cooperating_agency\": \"\", \"related_literature\": \"Recent studies associate well-designed interventions in educational technology with measurable efficiency, quality, and satisfaction gains. Adoption depends on usability, trust, accessibility, and the readiness of the people who will use the system.\", \"specific_objectives\": [{\"description\": \"Assess reading levels of participating pupils\"}, {\"description\": \"Develop the adaptive comprehension tool\"}, {\"description\": \"Measure reading gains over one school quarter\"}], \"proponent_department\": \"Department of Electronics Engineering\", \"checked_verified_by_name\": \"Dr. Maria Elena Santos\", \"recommending_approval_name\": \"Dr. Celeste M. Flores\"}', 0, 1, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-13 02:30:06', '2026-09-13 02:30:06'),
