414, \"id\": \"section-cv-1-awards\", \"label\": \"CV 1 · R&D Awards\", \"width\": 0.8799836588840858, \"height\": 0.09155984210152912, \"pageNumber\": 1}, {\"x\": 0.059967321508071, \"y\": 0.7955128270336705, \"id\": \"section-cv-1-projects\", \"label\": \"CV 1 · R&D Projects Headed/Conducted\", \"width\": 0.8799836588840858, \"height\": 0.09953226594843416, \"pageNumber\": 1}, {\"x\": 0.059967321508071, \"y\": 0.13119656815488115, \"id\": \"section-cv-1-publications\", \"label\": \"CV 1 · R&D Related Publications (last 3 years)\", \"width\": 0.8799836588840858, \"height\": 0.13183763292100695, \"pageNumber\": 2}, {\"x\": 0.059967321508071, \"y\": 0.2630342010758881, \"id\": \"section-cv-1-presentations\", \"label\": \"CV 1 · R&D Presentation (last 3 years)\", \"width\": 0.8799836588840858, \"height\": 0.06865619105151581, \"pageNumber\": 2}], \"version\": 1, \"checksum\": \"c03d821d7cb15bb9e0e680a55134e712c44dcbabb3a1f07f722a8497408fb58c\"}}', 0, 2, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-13 02:45:49', '2026-09-13 02:45:49'),
(220, 32, NULL, 'detailed_proposal', 0, 'proposal-packages/lifecycle-demo/22/v1/detailed_proposal-0.pdf', 'e-learning-micro-course-platform-for-senior-high-stem-review-detailed-research-proposal.pdf', 'application/pdf', 247987, '2f53bdaae2927c0ae1a3187758aa7292b5d25103b101611aa722d92c3f7012c0', '{\"sdgs\": [4, 9, 10], \"staff\": [], \"rationale\": \"Current practice in learning platforms still depends on manual processes and fragmented records. This leads to slow turnaround, limited visibility, and inconsistent reporting. A structured and technology-enabled approach can shorten processing time, strengthen traceability, and make outcomes easier to measure while keeping stakeholders in control of decisions.\", \"references\": \"Torres, D. (2025). Micro-learning for entrance exam preparation. Asian Journal of Distance Education, 20(1), 88-105. Santos, M. (2025). Applied research methods for community-centered technology. Philippine Journal of Science, 154(2), 101-115.\", \"methodology\": {\"data_analysis\": \"Quantitative results will be summarized using descriptive statistics, while qualitative feedback will undergo thematic analysis.\", \"research_design\": \"The study will use a developmental research design with mixed-method evaluation.\", \"specific_methods\": \"Researchers will review existing workflows, co-design the solution with stakeholders, implement it iteratively, and evaluate it through controlled pilot testing.\"}, \"introduction\": \"The project E-Learning Micro-Course Platform for Senior High STEM Review responds to persistent gaps in learning platforms, where fragmented processes limit reliability and responsiveness. This study designs and evaluates a practical solution grounded in the day-to-day needs of its intended users.\", \"leader_email\": \"23-73453@g.batstate-u.edu.ph\", \"leader_title\": \"Mr.\", \"project_title\": \"E-Learning Micro-Course Platform for Senior High STEM Review\", \"leader_contact\": \"09170000005\", \"project_leader\": \"Djanisse Villaflor\", \"executive_brief\": \"This project will design, build, and evaluate an offline-friendly micro-course platform for STEM entrance review to improve how learning platforms is carried out in partner communities and campus units.\", \"research_agenda\": \"Quality Education and Human Development\", \"approved_by_name\": \"Dr. Patricia Anne Villanueva\", \"expected_outputs\": {\"patent\": [], \"policy\": [{\"description\": \"An adoption guide for university and community stakeholders\"}], \"product\": [{\"description\": \"An offline-friendly micro-course platform for STEM entrance review\"}], \"publication\": [{\"description\": \"One peer-reviewed research article\"}], \"social_impact\": [{\"description\": \"Improved access to timely and reliable services for the target community\"}], \"people_service\": [{\"description\": \"A validated usability and acceptance report from pilot participants\"}], \"economic_impact\": [{\"description\": \"More efficient use of institutional and community resources\"}], \"place_partnership\": [{\"description\": \"A working partnership between the university and participating community sites\"}]}, \"proponent_campus\": \"Alangilan Campus\", \"responsibilities\": [{\"name\": \"Djanisse Villaflor\", \"duties\": \"Leads project planning, implementation, quality assurance, data analysis, and reporting.\", \"percentage\": 100}], \"general_objective\": \"Develop and evaluate an offline-friendly micro-course platform for STEM entrance review.\", \"proponent_college\": \"College of Informatics and Computing Sciences\", \"_revision_sections\": {\"regions\": [{\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.11314105172442576, \"id\": \"section-project-information\", \"label\": \"I. Research Project Title\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.028846153846153848, \"pageNumber\": 1}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.1419872055705796, \"id\": \"section-research-agenda\", \"label\": \"II. Research Agenda\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.02425208458533654, \"pageNumber\": 1}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.16623929015591613, \"id\": \"section-sdgs\", \"label\": \"III. Sustainable Development Goal\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.16837610750116855, \"pageNumber\": 1}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.33461539765708465, \"id\": \"section-project-team\", \"label\": \"IV. Project Leader and Staff\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.09391021728515624, \"pageNumber\": 1}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.4285256149422409, \"id\": \"section-proponent\", \"label\": \"V. Proponent Agency\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.0623931884765625, \"pageNumber\": 1}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.4909188034188034, \"id\": \"section-cooperating-agency\", \"label\": \"VI. Cooperating Agency\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.023183773725460734, \"pageNumber\": 1}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.5141025771442641, \"id\": \"section-executive-brief\", \"label\": \"VII. Executive Brief\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.04946579892411191, \"pageNumber\": 1}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.5635683760683761, \"id\": \"section-rationale\", \"label\": \"VIII. Rationale\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.07767095321264023, \"pageNumber\": 1}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.6412393292810163, \"id\": \"section-objectives\", \"label\": \"IX. Objectives of the Project\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.15085468129215077, \"pageNumber\": 1}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.7920940105731671, \"id\": \"section-expected-outputs\", \"label\": \"X. Expected Output of the Project\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.1278846202752529, \"pageNumber\": 1}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.91997863084842, \"id\": \"section-literature\", \"label\": \"XI. Introduction and Related Literature\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.05686963888315057, \"pageNumber\": 1}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.04428178836137821, \"id\": \"section-literature\", \"label\": \"XI. Introduction and Related Literature\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.12676519410223022, \"pageNumber\": 2}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.17104698246360844, \"id\": \"section-methodology\", \"label\": \"XII. Methodology\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.14722227438902244, \"pageNumber\": 2}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.31826925685263086, \"id\": \"section-responsibilities\", \"label\": \"XIII. Duties and Responsibilities\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.06217943501268697, \"pageNumber\": 2}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.3804486918653178, \"id\": \"section-work-plan\", \"label\": \"XIV. Major Activities / Work Plan\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.023183773725460734, \"pageNumber\": 2}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.4036324655907786, \"id\": \"section-budget\", \"label\": \"XV. Line-Item Budget\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.06816000653128336, \"pageNumber\": 2}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.47179247212206193, \"id\": \"section-references\", \"label\": \"XVI. References\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.06777896718082273, \"pageNumber\": 2}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.5395714393028846, \"id\": \"section-curriculum-vitae\", \"label\": \"XVII. Curriculum Vitae\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.3490479558961003, \"pageNumber\": 2}, {\"x\": 0.07401960659650417, \"y\": 0.888619395198985, \"id\": \"section-signatories\", \"label\": \"Approval Signatories\", \"width\": 0.8518791261062123, \"height\": 0.08822887453258554, \"pageNumber\": 2}, {\"x\": 0.07026143790849673, \"y\": 0.04428178836137821, \"id\": \"section-signatories\", \"label\": \"Approval Signatories\", \"width\": 0.8550653594771241, \"height\": 0.9325664813701924, \"pageNumber\": 3}], \"version\": 1, \"checksum\": \"2f53bdaae2927c0ae1a3187758aa7292b5d25103b101611aa722d92c3f7012c0\"}, \"cooperating_agency\": \"\", \"related_literature\": \"Recent studies associate well-designed interventions in learning platforms with measurable efficiency, quality, and satisfaction gains. Adoption depends on usability, trust, accessibility, and the readiness of the people who will use the system.\", \"specific_objectives\": [{\"description\": \"Design micro-course modules from past STEM assessments\"}, {\"description\": \"Build the low-bandwidth learning platform\"}, {\"description\": \"Measure completion and mock exam improvement\"}], \"proponent_department\": \"Department of Information Technology\", \"checked_verified_by_name\": \"Dr. Maria Elena Santos\", \"recommending_approval_name\": \"Dr. Celeste M. Flores\"}', 0, 2, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-13 02:45:49', '2026-09-13 02:45:49'),
